ol.li:
Lint: required header and stanza fields present;
        required-but-optional fields explicitly valued or "Undisclosed";
        Status in vocabulary; dates parse; every evaluation block complete
        for its stated tier; tiers recomputed and downgraded where
        unsupported.

ul.li:
Stale mirrors and caches. Expires bounds the damage;
        validators MUST surface staleness rather than silently serving old
        claims.
